# PostgreSQL Flex: **${instance_name}**

## Details

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Instance ID** | `${instance_id}` |
| **PostgreSQL Version** | `${version}` |
| **Host** | `${host}` |
| **Port** | `${port}` |
| **Database** | `${database_name}` |
| **Username** | `${username}` |
| **Password** | `${password}` |
| **Allowed Source Ranges** | `${acl}` |

## Connect

```sh
psql "postgresql://${username}@${host}:${port}/${database_name}?sslmode=require"
```

Your client must reach the instance from one of the allowed source ranges listed above.
